cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article below and this software release."
title: "IFITM3-bulk-analysis: analysis code for 'The innate immunity protein IFITM3 modulates microglial states in Alzheimer's disease'"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Jinrui
    alias: Louis Liu
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0778-4701"
    affiliation: "Computational and Systems Biology Program, Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/louis-jliu/IFITM3-bulk-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for the bulk RNA-seq interaction analysis (DESeq2, Ifitm3 knockout x 5xFAD),
  gene set enrichment analysis (fgsea) and human microglial gene program meta-analysis
  (ROSMAP snRNA-seq) in the Nature Aging manuscript "The innate immunity protein IFITM3
  modulates microglial states in Alzheimer's disease". Reproduces Fig. 2h-k,
  Extended Data Fig. 2g and Fig. 5e.
keywords:
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - IFITM3
  - microglia
  - 5xFAD
  - RNA-seq
  - DESeq2
  - GSEA
